  "Code & schemas — MIT": "Código ha esquema — MIT",
  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Techapyrã código-gua, JSON Schema-kuéra, ha plantilla política oñemoñe'ẽkuaáva máquina rupive-gua oguereko licencia MIT ndaha'éiramo oje'e ambue. Ikatu eipuru chupekuéra nde tenda-pe ijehegui.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Jeike rape derécho ojoajúva",
  "Commercial Redistribution": "Redistribución Comercial",
  "Commercial use": "Jeporu Comercial",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "Jeporu comercial oipota contacto",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Oñembohasáva Bletchley AI Safety Summit rire ha Yoshua Bengio oisãmbyhýva, 100 rasa jehesa'ỹijohare oipytyvõva 30 tetã aja-gui, UN, OECD ha EU reheve, ko informe independiente ombojoaju umi prueba científico ko'ág̃agua IA frontera capacidad ha riesgo-gua rehegua — he'i sistema sa'i ikatúmava ohechakuaa oñemyesakã hína ramo ha omoambue tembiapo upévare.",
  "Companion media": "Medio irũ rembiapo",
  "Compensation models tied to learning depth": "Modelo ñemyengovia-gua ojoajúva jehepyme'ẽ oñembo'e ipypuku ndive",
  "Conditions (comma-separated)": "Condición-kuéra (coma reheve oñembojoaju)",
  "Consciousness": "Conciencia",
