  "Content": "Contenido",
  "Content policy summary": "Contenido política resumen",
  "Continue to site": "Esegui tendápe",
  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Emoambue derécho declaración-kuéra mercado licenciamiento ikatúva omba'apo-pe, web binário ijurujáva/oñembotýva rangue.",
  "Copied ✓": "Ojekopia ✓",
  "Copy": "Ekopia",
  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Momba'apo hekópe: jehesa'ỹijo borrador independiente-kuéra, protokolo propuesta-kuéra, ha peteĩ experimento especificación ijurujáva.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Oñemyatyrõ peteĩ default ymaguare: Bélgica (BE) ko'ág̃a ojoaju holandés-pe, francés rangue — flamenco ñe'ẽhára ha'e tetã apytépe hetavéva (~60%) valón francés ñe'ẽhára ári (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Oñemyatyrõ peteĩ default ymaguare: Kazajistán (KZ) ko'ág̃a ojoaju kazajo-pe, ruso rangue, oĩ ma haguére traducción kazajo — kóva ha'e pe jejavy oñemyatyrõ hague Bélgica-pe ojejapo haguéicha.",
  "Crawler access rules": "Crawler jeike rembiapoukapy",
  "Crawler simulator": "Crawler simulador",
  "Currency": "Viru",
  "Custom tier": "Nivel personalizádo",
  "Daily Nous reports on a retracted Journal of Medical Ethics submission containing multiple fabricated, AI-hallucinated references — complete with fake university affiliations and defunct email addresses — that the author reportedly left uncorrected even after being given a chance to fix proofs. The piece contrasts this with Bioethics, whose automated reference-checking would have caught the problem, and argues the real bottleneck isn't detection technology (one commenter's script flagged the fake citations in under a minute) but unpaid reviewer labor and publishing incentives that reward throughput over scrutiny.": "Daily Nous omombe'u peteĩ kuatia oñemboykéva Journal of Medical Ethics-pe ojejerure hague, orekóva heta referencia japu, IA alucinación-gua — universidad afiliación japu ha email opamavéva reheve — pe autor he'ipahárõ ndoiporãiete hague ni oñeme'ẽ jave chupe oportunidad omyatyrõ hag̃ua. Ko tekste ojoguereko Bioethics-pe, orekóva peteĩ ñemboheko automático referencia-gua ohechakuaáva ko apañuái, ha he'i pe apañuái tee ndaha'éiha tecnología jehecha-gua (peteĩ comentarista script ohechakuaa umi cita japu peteĩ aravo'i sa'i pyre), ha katu tembiapo revisor ndaojehepyme'ẽiva ha incentivo editorial oporohepyme'ẽ hetáva rehe, ani hemoañeteha rehe.",
  "Data free-riding vs. trillion-dollar AI valuations": "Data jeporu ohepyme'ẽ'ỹre, IA valoración billón-icha rovake",
  "Demis Hassabis proposed a FINRA-style regulator for frontier model releases: labs would submit models for review up to 30 days before deployment, voluntary at first, with a path toward mandatory compliance in the US market.": "Demis Hassabis oikuaauka peteĩ regulador FINRA-icha modelo frontera jehechauka-rã: laboratorio-kuéra ome'ẽta modelo revisión-pe 30 ára peve oñemoĩ mboyve, oñepyrũ jave voluntario ramo, ha oĩ tape cumplimiento obligatorio-pe mercado EEUU-pe g̃uarã.",
  "Denied": "Oñembotove",
  "Deployable policy starter template": "Plantilla política oñemoĩkuaáva oñepyrũ hag̃ua",
  "Deployable policy starter template at /downloads/agiright-policy-starter.zip — a minimal static site with the full machine-readable layer, ready for Cloudflare Pages or any static host.": "Plantilla política oñemoĩkuaáva /downloads/agiright-policy-starter.zip-pe — peteĩ tenda estática mínima, ñuãha oñemoñe'ẽkuaáva máquina rupive opavavete reheve, oñemoĩkuaáva Cloudflare Pages térã oimeraẽ host estático-pe.",
  "Deploying machine-readable policies on your site": "Emoĩ política oñemoñe'ẽkuaáva máquina rupive nde tenda-pe",
  "Disclaimer": "Ñemyesakã",
  "Distinct from human UI, SEO, or plain APIs, the AI Ingestion & Capability Layer gives websites a machine-facing architecture: a Manifest Layer (entry points like /llms.txt and /ai/manifest.json), a Corpus Layer (machine-readable knowledge), a Capability Layer (agent-callable tools), and a Governance Layer (provenance, licensing, versioning). Static-first, upgradeable toward APIs and MCP. Note: in this paper AICL names the ingestion architecture; on this site's protocol pages AICL refers to the AI Content Licensing Layer.": "Ambue UI yvypóra g̃uarã, SEO, térã API mba'yru-gui, AI Ingestion & Capability Layer ome'ẽ tenda web-kuérape peteĩ arquitectura máquina g̃uarã: Ñuãha Manifesto (jeike rape /llms.txt ha /ai/manifest.json-icha), Ñuãha Corpus (arandu oñemoñe'ẽkuaáva máquina rupive), Ñuãha Capacidad (herramienta agente ojeruréva), ha Ñuãha Sãmbyhy (orígenes, licenciamiento, versionamiento). Estático raẽ, ikatúva ojembopu'ã API ha MCP peve. Jehaipy: ko kuatia-pe AICL he'ise arquitectura ingestión-gua; ko tenda protokolo rogue-kuéra-pe AICL he'ise IA Contenido Licenciamiento Ñuãha.",
  "Docs": "Documentación",
  "Docs / Examples": "Documentación / Techapyrã",
  "Document library": "Biblioteca Documento",
  "Does AI have rights — and which framings are even coherent?": "IA orekópa derécho — ha máva marco ha'e koherente añete?",
  "Download": "Emboguejy",
  "Draft status": "Borrador reko",
  "Educational demo: HMAC-SHA256 with a shared secret, showing request-bound, expiring, verifiable license tokens. Production tokens should be signed asymmetrically, with the publisher’s public key discoverable under /.well-known/.": "Demo educativo: HMAC-SHA256 peteĩ secreto ojoajúva reheve, ohechauka token licencia pyendaguáva pedido-pe, oĩ tiempo límite ha ikatúva ojejesareko. Token producción-pegua ovaerã oñefirma asimétricamente, publicador clave pública ikatúva ojejuhu /.well-known/ guýpe.",
  "Eight more /topics entries, this time researched by an AI agent rather than curated by hand — same rule as before: every source fetched and confirmed live, summaries an original paraphrase, before anything gets added. 14 entries total.": "Poapy jehai pyahu /topics-pe, ko'ág̃a peteĩ agente IA ojehesa'ỹijóva ndive, ndaha'éi po rupive oñemboheko hague — pe rembiapoukapy peteĩcha: opa fuente ojehupyty ha ojejesareko oiko hína hag̃ua, resumen ha'e paráfrasis original, mba'eve oñembojoapy mboyve. 14 jehai opavave.",
  "Email": "Email",
  "Empirical Research": "Jehesa'ỹijo Empírico",
  "English edition →": "Edición inglés →",
  "Ensure openness is machine-executable — so goodwill is not discarded as legal uncertainty.": "Ejapo jepe'a ikatu hag̃ua máquina omba'apo hese — ani hag̃ua py'a porã oñembotove incertidumbre legal ramo.",
  "Epistemology": "Epistemología",
  "Ethics & Moral Status": "Ética ha Reko Moral",
